FR-AUTH-05: Users must be able to recover forgotten passwords.
FR-AUTH-06: Optional social authentication may be supported.
FR-AUTH-07: Users must select an initial role: Mentor or Mentee.
FR-AUTH-08: Users must complete role-specific onboarding.
FR-AUTH-09: Authentication sessions must be securely managed.
FR-AUTH-10: Users must be able to update account information.
FR-AUTH-11: The system must enforce role-based permissions on the backend.
FR-AUTH-12: Users must be able to request account deactivation or deletion.
FR-AUTH-13: Authentication attempts must be rate-limited.
FR-AUTH-14: The system must support appropriate administrative account controls.
Acceptance Criteria
Valid registration creates an account.
Duplicate email registrations are rejected.
Email verification works.
Password recovery works.
Users cannot access unauthorised role-specific resources.
Sessions expire according to configured security policies.
Account deletion requests are recorded and processed appropriately.
